HB0161 Hydrogen severance tax.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Tarver, Clouston, Davis, Larson, JT
and Lawley and Senator(s) Barlow and Boner
AN ACT relating to mine product taxes; providing for the taxation of certain
hydrogen production; specifying tax rates for different types of hydrogen
production; providing for the administration of the tax; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
